  "documentation": "Revision Notes:\n1.1.0 - Fix Diagnostic custom properties \n1.2.0 - Added OOS Script for parent/child enable\n1.2.1 - Updated OOS Script fucntion to have logger\n1.3.0 - Change expresson of \"In_Alarm\" tag to a run a script on gateway\n1.3.1 - Made \"Site\" paremeter pull informatoin from parent \"{Site}\" Parameter\n1.3.2 - Changed alarm pipeline on \"Is_Connected\" tag from \"Tag\" binding to \"Expression\"\n1.3.3 - Updated \"Maintenance\" script to remove overide\n1.3.4 - \"Maintenance\" script  changes to accomodate new UI\n1.3.5 - \"Maintenance\" script minor update to handle audit log errors.\n1.3.6 - \"Maintenance\" moved the audit log write to bottom, commented out \".AlarmEvalEnabled\" lines.\n1.4.0 - \"Is_Connected\" tag changed from OPC to Expression tag. Also added a third condition to the \"Loss of comms\" alarm enable condition.\n1.4.1 - A third condition was added to the Modbus and CLX \"Is_Connected\" tag expression for MLX devices\n1.5.0-dev - Developing CX-Mode Intergtration\n1.5.1 - Replace Alarms/In_Alarm Value expression from runScript to isAlarmActive expression",
